"The demon is a Lesser Demon Prince, and the cult summoned it to be born in the child."
"Weakened as it is, the demon can barely defend itself, and a soul that attacks it now can tear it apart."
"A soul that destroys it and takes in its shreds earns the Achievements for defeating a Lesser Demon Prince unborn and for consuming another soul."
"If the demon recovers before it is destroyed, it will try to devour the soul that shares its body."
